WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.220
We're already checked in for this visit.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.600
Check the client's name here before you
start, so you know who the note is for.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.370
Tap the pencil beside their name,

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.250
then write what you need to record in Note
text.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.510
Have a quick read through before you tap
Save.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.880
Then open the saved note to check the
details.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.550
If you spot something later, tap Revise,

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.640
make the change and save again.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.600
The earlier version stays in the history,
so you can look back at what it said.
